{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a human. You will inspect this Office Creation, intended for human use, and report the number of anomalies you find.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Correct answers progress you to the next stage. Complete all stages for Ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incorrect answers will result in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/TSU03-cropped.gif?t=1745353845\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They See Us</strong> is a horror anomaly-hunting experience inspired by psychological horrors like 'Cabin Factory' and '<i>The Exit 8</i>' with the added chaos of multiplayer and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your team agree on how many anomalies there are before the time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-4 human players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convenient 'clicker' counter to keep track of anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matchmaking and Steam Friend invitations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/TSU04-cropped.gif?t=1745353845\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/Cipactli_Logo3.png?t=1745353845\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For millennia, <strong>Cipactli Dynamics</strong> has stood as a beacon of resilience, wisdom, and progress. With roots reaching deep into the past, we have preserved traditions of strength and vision, adapting through the ages to shape the future. Our commitment to innovation, longevity, and influence has positioned us as an enduring force in industries across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At Cipactli Dynamics, we believe in <strong>continuity beyond generations</strong>\u2014an unbroken chain of knowledge and power that stretches from the world\u2019s earliest civilizations into the boundless possibilities of tomorrow. Our methods are time-honoured, our reach unparalleled, and our <strong>dedication to what lies beyond</strong> remains absolute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The past is our foundation. The future is our domain.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551100?t=1745353845","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/2b15213ec0185e8283a6cb45943b4eb31f89fdff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745353845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/e6b014463bb0f3e28eee2891ae1ef2d00c94b01b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745353845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/e6b014463bb0f3e28eee2891ae1ef2d00c94b01b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745353845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There are scenes of violence and horror such as blood pouring and gushing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a human. You will inspect this Office Creation, intended for human use, and report the number of anomalies you find.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Correct answers progress you to the next stage. Complete all stages for Ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incorrect answers will result in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/TSU03-cropped.gif?t=1745353845\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They See Us</strong> is a horror anomaly-hunting experience inspired by psychological horrors like 'Cabin Factory' and '<i>The Exit 8</i>' with the added chaos of multiplayer and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your team agree on how many anomalies there are before the time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-4 human players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convenient 'clicker' counter to keep track of anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matchmaking and Steam Friend invitations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/TSU04-cropped.gif?t=1745353845\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/Cipactli_Logo3.png?t=1745353845\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For millennia, <strong>Cipactli Dynamics</strong> has stood as a beacon of resilience, wisdom, and progress. With roots reaching deep into the past, we have preserved traditions of strength and vision, adapting through the ages to shape the future. Our commitment to innovation, longevity, and influence has positioned us as an enduring force in industries across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At Cipactli Dynamics, we believe in <strong>continuity beyond generations</strong>\u2014an unbroken chain of knowledge and power that stretches from the world\u2019s earliest civilizations into the boundless possibilities of tomorrow. Our methods are time-honoured, our reach unparalleled, and our <strong>dedication to what lies beyond</strong> remains absolute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The past is our foundation. The future is our domain.</strong></p>","developers":["MalumGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description